Package: amd-video-enhancer
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @PACKAGE_MAINTAINER@
Depends: bash
Recommends: ffmpeg
Homepage: https://github.com/Rolaand-Jayz/AMD-V.E.-
Description: Open-alpha AMD GPU video enhancement app
 Native package built from the Arch-origin staged release root.
 .
 This package keeps the application and bundled userspace dependencies private
 under /opt/amd-video-enhancer and exposes only thin entrypoints under /usr/bin.
 .
 Arch Linux on Ryzen 7 7800X3D + Radeon RX 7900 GRE is the only tested stack.
 All other distro packages are experimental in the current open alpha.
